            <p>I’m a senior full-stack engineer who likes hard problems solved simply. For more than a decade I’ve helped startups and large enterprises ship products that scale, modernize legacy stacks, and keep teams aligned from idea to production.</p>

            <p>My background spans <strong>logistics and consulting</strong>, so I’m used to bridging business constraints with technical tradeoffs — architecture, performance, security, and delivery rhythm all matter. Technically, I work across <strong>.NET, C#, JavaScript/TypeScript, SQL Server, MongoDB, Azure, AWS</strong>, and solid DevOps practices.</p>

            <p>As a teammate and occasional lead, I care about clarity: documentation, code review, and mentoring so the whole group levels up. I’m known for translating stakeholder goals into an executable plan and shipping without surprises.</p>

            <p>I’m open to <strong>contract or full-time</strong> work and am <strong>fully remote-ready</strong>. If you need a senior engineer who combines depth with collaboration, <a href="mailto:mattzanco@gmail.com?subject=Let%E2%80%99s%20connect%20%E2%80%94%20Matt%20Zanco">send a note</a> or use the links below.</p>

